<title>JAPAN: Makino Milling - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Makino Milling - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 56.29		vs	   46.15</p>
<p> Operating	    2.52		vs	  839    million</p>
<p> Current		2.59		vs	    1.26</p>
<p> Net		    2.31		vs	    1.13</p>
<p> EPS		   24.55 yen	  vs	   11.96 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 22.22 yen	  vs	     nil yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Makino Milling Machine Co Ltd is a major machine tool builder.  </p>
<p>From the 1996/97 year, the firm said it adopted different accounting rules in calculating its foreign-currency denominated debts and credits. The change alone increased the firm's group current and net profits by 254 million yen each in 1996/97 from the figures reached under the previous accounting methods.</p>
</text>
